<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Representative ONIX for Books 3.1 sample record, hand-built in reference-tag
  syntax to match real-world publisher feeds (EDItEUR's own downloadable
  samples require an interactive licence click-through on editeur.org that
  isn't reachable from this sandbox, and the DNB mirror is a zip on a
  non-allowlisted host — so this file is modelled directly on the EDItEUR
  ONIX 3.1 Product Information Message spec instead of a fetched original).
  It covers the composite structures a v1 converter needs to handle:
  multiple identifiers, a full contributor with bio, subjects from two
  different schemes, description/text content, an image link, and a
  supply/price/availability block.
-->
